## Interface: 16001
## Version: 223
## Title: VCF Helper
## Notes: The helper for the VCF app (Voice Commander Forever). Keep it ticked on: most voice commands need it, and VCF must be running for voice. It reads your spells, items and key bindings for the app and gives voice commands their own keys, without changing your key bindings. When you ask by voice, it outlines things in windows and bags (vendors, mail, bank, quests, trainers, professions, loot rolls), shows their tooltip in a bigger box, and copies the game's own tooltip into that box. It shows the coin purse, lets you move each bag, moves and sizes screen pieces in the game's Edit Mode layouts (limited editing), reads quests aloud with WoW's own text-to-speech, and widens the interact range while you fish.
